<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall practise as a counsellor unless he holds a valid practising certificate issued under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) shall be liable to disciplinary proceedings under Part VI and shall not be entitled to recover in any court any fee, charge or remuneration for his counselling services."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
