<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, after consulting the Board, amend the Second Schedule by order published in the Gazette."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
