<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "On receipt of an application under section 25, the Board shall consider the application."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
