<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The President shall sign every entry made in the Register."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
