<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar shall publish in the Gazette the name and address of every person whose name and particulars have been entered in the Register under subsection (2)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
