<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Board refuses to register the applicant, the Registrar shall immediately serve a notice of the Board's refusal on the applicant."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
