<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who is neither a Malaysian citizen nor a permanent resident of Malaysia who intends to practise as a counsellor in Malaysia may apply in the prescribed form for temporary registration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
