<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
