<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_48__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The President of the Board or any officer authorised by him may, for the purpose of carrying out the objects of this Act or any regulations made under this Act, at any reasonable time and upon the production of his certificate of authorisation enter, inspect and examine any premises or any area including any building or structure thereon which belongs to or is used, whether permanently or otherwise, or whether or not registered for use, by a registered counsellor."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
