<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the report submitted by the Investigation Committee states that sufficient grounds exist for disciplinary proceedings to be taken against a registered counsellor, the Disciplinary Commitee shall inquire into the case."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A registered counsellor against whom disciplinary proceedings are taken shall be given an opportunity to make representations against the disciplinary charge laid against him before a decision is arrived at by the Disciplinary Committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_38__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The registered counsellor against whom disciplinary proceedings have been taken shall be notified by the Registrar by registered post of the decision of the Disciplinary Committee as soon as possible after the making of such decision."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
