<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~part_VI__cl_39__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board may, if it considers fit, suspend the practising certificate of a registered counsellor for a period not exceeding six months pending the completion of an investigation by the Investigation Committee and inquiry by the Disciplinary Committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
