<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board shall meet at least twice a year at a time and place to be appointed by the President."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "At least fourteen days notice in writing shall be given to the members."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The President shall preside at a meeting of the Board and in his absence the members of the Board shall elect one of their number to preside over the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The quorum of the Board shall be seven."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Every member of the Board present shall be entitled to one vote."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "If on a question to be determined by the Board there is an equality of votes, the President, or where the President is absent, the member presiding over that meeting, shall have a casting vote."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Members of the Board shall be paid such allowances as the Minister may determine."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_3__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_3__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
