<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5> <https://schema.org/text> "( 1 ) T he Board shall have a common seal-which shall bear such device as the Board shall, approve and such seal may be broken, changed, altered or made anew as the Board thinks fit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
