<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal shall be kept in the custody of the President or such other person as may be authorised by the Board in writing and shall be authenticated by the President or such authorised officer."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
