<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
