<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subparagraph (3), any document or instrument which if executed by a person not being a body corporate would not be required to be under seal may in like manner be executed by the Board; and any such document or instrument may be executed on- behalf of the Board by any member of the Board generally or specially authorised by the Board in that behalf."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
