<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@/~sched_1__para_6> <https://schema.org/text> "or his partner, any interest in any company or undertaking with which the Board proposes to make any contract or having any interest in any such contractor in any matter under discussion by the Board shall disclose to the Board the fact of his interest and the nature thereof, and such disclosure shall be recorded in the minutes of the Board and, unless specifically authorised thereto by the President, such member shall take no part in deliberation or decision of the Board relating to the contract or matter."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/38/eng@> .
